{"id":28247,"author":"ShadowHawk777","body":"\u003cspan id=\"docs-internal-guid-149d409a-45df-431e-57a4-f1242bb7387e\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eAge: \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e16\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eTimezone: \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eCentral standard time\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eDo you have Teamspeak?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eyes\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eDo you have Discord?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e yes\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eDo you have access to a recording software?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e I will install that soon.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eCRITERIA 1: SELF REFLECTION/EVALUATION\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eDo you have any experience as a moderator on other servers?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e-No\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eWhat is your biggest weakness and how will it affect your moderating?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e-My weakness is being able to remember what I know and how specifically to handle it. Also, I do not know how much homework I get on a daily basis. But if I become a moderator, I will definitely commit to being on there more.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eWhat qualities do you think a leader must have? Would you consider yourself a leader? \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eWhy/why not?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e-A leader must be willing to do what is right even when everyone else is not. I would consider myself a leader, because I feel like I am inspirational, patient (for the most part), and I am focussed on always doing my best to get better at what I struggle with.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eWhat attributes distinguish yourself from \u0026nbsp;other players that qualify you to be a moderator?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e-I am a hard worker and I do not complain about any task given to me.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eWhat skills do you believe you should have when interacting with the community? Do you believe you have these skills?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e-Overall, being friendly and kind. Yes, I do believe I have these.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eWhat in your opinion are the three main character traits a moderator must have when moderating?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e-A Moderator should be observant, see a problem and solve it. A Moderator should interact with the community and be active so everyone knows he cares for the community. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eA Moderator should be humble, and not be mean spirited and if someone says, “hey, can you do this and this?” They should respond, within reason to the request, and do it.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eCRITERIA 2: GENERAL SITUATIONS\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eYou notice a moderator giving out a lot of false bans. They almost always have insufficient evidence or sometimes no evidence and they don’t seem to care. You notice it but other staff members don’t. What would you do?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e-Talk to the person and see his reasoning, ask him if he needs help. If he does not stop, notify a senior.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e\u003cbr class=\"kix-line-break\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eYou are in Teamspeak with a few other players and they begin talking quite disrespectfully about a particular staff member. You agree with what they’re saying to an extent, but the conversation starts to become racial and very disrespectful soon after. You are all in a nightclub channel where this is allowed. What would you do?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e-It does not matter if you do not like the person, you should always show respect. I would tell them to stop being disrespectful and say there is no need to be like that.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eYou are in an Avicus team. One of your teammates is also an Avicus Staff member. One day in your team discord the team member/staff member posts a screenshot of a thread that only staff members can see. The content in the screenshot isn’t very important/confidential but only staff members could see it on the forums. If anything, what would you do?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e-Ask them to stop, tell them to ask before posting the content, and if they do not stop, talk to a senior. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eSome senior staff members are in teamspeak joking around with each other. They are removing others ranks, creating certain channels and even harassing certain users. They don’t mean any harm but some players in the channel feel a bit angry that they are using their permissions the way they are. What would you do?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e-Tell them to stop because some people do not like it and to try to listen when people get angry and do better. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eCRITERIA 3: OTHER\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eNOTE: This is a new criteria and these questions are less to do with right/wrong answer and more to do with us getting to know you. Please answer these honestly. There is no right or wrong answer.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eWhy do you want to be a moderator?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e-I feel it would increase my leadership ability\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e-It would help me learn certain circumstances of what to do in a community\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eWhat does Avicus mean to you?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e-Avicus is my relax server. I normally go on it because no one will play with me or I want to get a good competition of pvp. I also enjoy playing with the people on Avicus because it’s still one great server.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eAnything specific the staff team could do better?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e-No, I have not noticed anything.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eWhy did you choose to apply at Avicus?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e-I wanted to be committed to something great, Avicus may be small, but I still view it as a great server.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eDo you have anything else to add to your application?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e-Nope\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/span\u003e","body_tagged":"\u003cspan id=\"docs-internal-guid-149d409a-45df-431e-57a4-f1242bb7387e\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eAge: \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e16\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eTimezone: \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eCentral standard time\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eDo you have Teamspeak?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eyes\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eDo you have Discord?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e yes\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eDo you have access to a recording software?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e I will install that soon.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eCRITERIA 1: SELF REFLECTION/EVALUATION\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eDo you have any experience as a moderator on other servers?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e-No\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eWhat is your biggest weakness and how will it affect your moderating?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e-My weakness is being able to remember what I know and how specifically to handle it. Also, I do not know how much homework I get on a daily basis. But if I become a moderator, I will definitely commit to being on there more.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eWhat qualities do you think a leader must have? Would you consider yourself a leader? \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eWhy/why not?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e-A leader must be willing to do what is right even when everyone else is not. I would consider myself a leader, because I feel like I am inspirational, patient (for the most part), and I am focussed on always doing my best to get better at what I struggle with.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eWhat attributes distinguish yourself from \u0026nbsp;other players that qualify you to be a moderator?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e-I am a hard worker and I do not complain about any task given to me.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eWhat skills do you believe you should have when interacting with the community? Do you believe you have these skills?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e-Overall, being friendly and kind. Yes, I do believe I have these.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eWhat in your opinion are the three main character traits a moderator must have when moderating?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e-A Moderator should be observant, see a problem and solve it. A Moderator should interact with the community and be active so everyone knows he cares for the community. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eA Moderator should be humble, and not be mean spirited and if someone says, “hey, can you do this and this?” They should respond, within reason to the request, and do it.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eCRITERIA 2: GENERAL SITUATIONS\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eYou notice a moderator giving out a lot of false bans. They almost always have insufficient evidence or sometimes no evidence and they don’t seem to care. You notice it but other staff members don’t. What would you do?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e-Talk to the person and see his reasoning, ask him if he needs help. If he does not stop, notify a senior.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e\u003cbr class=\"kix-line-break\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eYou are in Teamspeak with a few other players and they begin talking quite disrespectfully about a particular staff member. You agree with what they’re saying to an extent, but the conversation starts to become racial and very disrespectful soon after. You are all in a nightclub channel where this is allowed. What would you do?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e-It does not matter if you do not like the person, you should always show respect. I would tell them to stop being disrespectful and say there is no need to be like that.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eYou are in an Avicus team. One of your teammates is also an Avicus Staff member. One day in your team discord the team member/staff member posts a screenshot of a thread that only staff members can see. The content in the screenshot isn’t very important/confidential but only staff members could see it on the forums. If anything, what would you do?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e-Ask them to stop, tell them to ask before posting the content, and if they do not stop, talk to a senior. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eSome senior staff members are in teamspeak joking around with each other. They are removing others ranks, creating certain channels and even harassing certain users. They don’t mean any harm but some players in the channel feel a bit angry that they are using their permissions the way they are. What would you do?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e-Tell them to stop because some people do not like it and to try to listen when people get angry and do better. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eCRITERIA 3: OTHER\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eNOTE: This is a new criteria and these questions are less to do with right/wrong answer and more to do with us getting to know you. Please answer these honestly. There is no right or wrong answer.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eWhy do you want to be a moderator?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e-I feel it would increase my leadership ability\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e-It would help me learn certain circumstances of what to do in a community\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eWhat does Avicus mean to you?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e-Avicus is my relax server. I normally go on it because no one will play with me or I want to get a good competition of pvp. I also enjoy playing with the people on Avicus because it’s still one great server.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eAnything specific the staff team could do better?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e-No, I have not noticed anything.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eWhy did you choose to apply at Avicus?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e-I wanted to be committed to something great, Avicus may be small, but I still view it as a great server.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eDo you have anything else to add to your application?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e-Nope\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/span\u003e","created_at":1504410994,"title":"Application Bazookabublegum","replies":[{"id":381295,"author":"BoldAndBrash","body":"\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px 9pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; font-weight: 700;\"\u003e[Denied]\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003e- I am sorry to say your application has been denied for:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px 9pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003e- Does not meet criteria, 3 days of playtime.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px 9pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eYou may not submit\u003c/span\u003e\u003cb style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003eanother\u003cb style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eapplication. Unless you manage to get enough playtime (3 days) before applications close, feel free to make another one. Thanks for applying!\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","body_tagged":"\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px 9pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; font-weight: 700;\"\u003e[Denied]\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003e- I am sorry to say your application has been denied for:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px 9pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003e- Does not meet criteria, 3 days of playtime.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px 9pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eYou may not submit\u003c/span\u003e\u003cb style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003eanother\u003cb style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eapplication. Unless you manage to get enough playtime (3 days) before applications close, feel free to make another one. Thanks for applying!\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","created_at":1504972063}]}